  "post_content": "<p>(28 fotos) Esta semana ha abierto sus puertas al p&uacute;blico Kingmat Onda, tienda de pintura y decoraci&oacute;n, en la avenida Mediterr&aacute;neo 14, junto a supermercado Aldi.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/IMG_9255.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Con una inmensa variedad de productos Tit&aacute;n, Titanlux, Tit&aacute;n Export o Tit&aacute;n Lak, cuenta adem&aacute;s con las firmas Ure&ntilde;a Color, Unilax o Imper. Y como productos complementarios (rodillos, brochas, escurrideras...), JEIVSA o COFAN.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pintureskingmatonda/img_9254.jpg\" alt=\"img_9254\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pintureskingmatonda/img_9255.jpg\" alt=\"img_9255\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pintureskingmatonda/img_9257.jpg\" alt=\"img_9257\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pintureskingmatonda/img_9258.jpg\" alt=\"img_9258\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pintureskingmatonda/img_9259.jpg\" alt=\"img_9259\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pintureskingmatonda/img_9261.jpg\" alt=\"img_9261\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pintureskingmatonda/img_9264.jpg\" alt=\"img_9264\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pintureskingmatonda/img_9266.jpg\" alt=\"img_9266\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439ef